  "description": "A language-agnostic planning and rewrite engine for .NET. Alembic plans operations over a tree of ops: you bring your own op types and rules, and it matches rules against the tree, applies them, and drives the rewrite to a result. The design distills the planner ideas of Apache Calcite — ops, traits, conventions, pattern-matching rules, and a planner — without the relational algebra, so the same machinery applies to any domain.",
